    "name": "React Native Testing Library",
    "descriptionZh": "React Native 的集成测试库文档站，主张测试越接近软件的真实用法越有底气，推动使用者只断言公开 API 而不去碰组件实现细节；站上按 12.x、13.x、14.x 分版本文档。",
    "takeawayZh": "写 RN 测试先看 Quick Start 与 Cookbook，别碰实现细节",
    "noteZh": "顶栏左边是 React Native Testing Library 的字标，右边排着带 CtrlK 提示的 Search、Docs、Cookbook、Examples 和一个版本入口。首屏大标题 JavaScript Integration testing for React Native，右侧引了 Kent C. Dodds 那句 The more your tests resemble the way your software is used, the more confidence they can give you.。标题下方并排 Quick Start 和 Explore API 两个按钮，再往下是三张虚线卡片 Maintainable / Reliable / Community Driven——Reliable 那张写的是 Promotes testing public APIs and avoiding implementation details.。卡片下面压着一条紫蓝色渐变横幅图，页脚落款 Copyright © 2026 Callstack Open Source。",
